410,16.9,1974,62,117,19],[24411,17.4,2012,59,120,21],[24412,17.7,2012,60,125,22]],"links":[["Yuma County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/colorado/yuma-county"],["ARC or PLC in Yuma County","/arc-plc/colorado/yuma-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years. On the middle of the grids in 2025, April to May ran 60% of normal and August to September ran 234%. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 26% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 23511 had its driest year in 1954 at 45% of normal.</p>"}
